license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Hyperuniform point clouds (stealthy blue noise, L1-ball and wrap-around
  discrepancy variants) on the unit hypercube [0,1)^D, for N = 2^10 to 2^17
  and D = 2 to 16 plus D = 23 and D = 32, obtained by spectral optimisation.
  Samples are periodic and can be randomised by shifts, extended in number of
  points by tiling, and reduced in dimension by projection.
keywords:
  - hyperuniformity
  - stealthy point processes
  - blue noise
  - quasi-Monte Carlo
  - structure factor
  - point clouds
